const projectPath="/projects/alexandria-duplex-cleanout/";const projectCrumbs=[["Home","/"],["Recent Work","/projects/"],["Alexandria Duplex Cleanout",projectPath]];const projectBody=pageHero(projectCrumbs,"Full Duplex Cleanout in Alexandria, Louisiana","A privacy-safe look at a substantial Clear Path property cleanout involving household junk, furniture and bulky materials, and appropriate exterior debris.",true)+`<section class="section"><div class="container article-layout"><article class="article-body"><p class="eyebrow">Project overview</p><h2>A full-property reset</h2><p>This Alexandria duplex required a broad cleanout scope rather than a single pickup. Clear Path removed agreed household junk and debris, furniture and bulky materials, and appropriate exterior debris. The primary removal work was completed in one working day.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Privacy note:</strong> Customer names, the property address, payment details, and sensitive circumstances are intentionally excluded.</div><h2>Scope</h2><ul><li>Full duplex/property cleanout</li><li>Household junk and general debris</li><li>Furniture and bulky-item removal</li><li>Appropriate exterior cleanup</li></ul><h2>Challenges</h2><p>A multi-area cleanout requires the whole scope to be understood before loading begins. Interior contents, bulky furniture, and exterior material each affect volume, labor, access, and disposal planning. No unverified structural, hazardous-material, or customer-specific challenges are claimed.</p><h2>Process</h2><ol><li>The removal areas and visible contents were assessed.</li><li>The agreed household contents, bulky pieces, and exterior debris were loaded as part of one coordinated scope.</li><li>The primary cleanout work was completed in one working day.</li><li>The cleared areas were documented without publishing private customer information.</li></ol><h2>Outcome</h2><p>The property moved from furnished and debris-filled areas toward open, usable rooms. This job demonstrates the kind of larger rental, landlord, realtor, estate, and household cleanout that Clear Path can assess from complete photos.</p></article><aside class="content-card article-aside"><h2>Project details</h2><ul class="plain-list"><li><strong>Location:</strong> Alexandria, Louisiana</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Duplex/property cleanout</li><li><strong>Duration:</strong> One primary working day</li><li><strong>Materials:</strong> Household junk, furniture, bulky items, exterior debris</li></ul><h3>Related services</h3><p><a href="/services/property-cleanouts/">Property Cleanouts</a></p><p><a href="/services/furniture-removal/">Furniture Removal</a></p><p><a href="/service-areas/alexandria-la/">Alexandria Service Area</a></p></aside></div></section><section class="section gray"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Before and after</p><h2>Real Alexandria project proof</h2><p>The source image is preserved without generating or substituting fake job photography.</p></div><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/assets/images/alexandria-duplex-living-room-before-after.jpg" width="1005" height="2094" loading="lazy" alt="Before and after comparison of living room contents removed during an Alexandria duplex cleanout"><figcaption>Living-room contents and bulky furniture before removal, followed by the cleared room.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>${cta("Planning a property cleanout?")}`;
